    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d980">

                <pb facs="0764" n="688" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg688"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/7645</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Pacific Mail Steamship Company
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-05-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 1, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram April 30. I have requested Secretary of Commerce to instruct
                    collector at San Francisco not to penalize your Company in case steamship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Newport</hi> takes aboard more passengers than she has
                    been authorized to carry.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
